            oa:hasSelector [ a oa:TextQuoteSelector ;
                oa:exact "And on what a page must carry: \"if I'm looking at a document, I should see everything, fully expanded: narratives, positions, the whole graph inside that document, and the edges that would lead me elsewhere and how to get to them. Actors, narratives, the strata up, and other positions outside the document that do not include the statements. … I want to see the full package and its edges at the navigational fidelity.\"" ;
